#. module: partner_scoring
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:partner_scoring.field_partner_tier__company_id
msgid ""
"Leave empty for a scale every subject is measured against. Setting it "
"narrows the scale to that company's subjects -- and to *only* those: a "
"subject with no company of its own resolves against company-less bands, so a"
" scale that is scoped by accident classifies nobody."
msgstr ""
"Déjelo vacío para una escala contra la que se mide todo sujeto. Fijarlo "
"restringe la escala a los sujetos de esa compañía -- y *sólo* a ellos: un "
"sujeto sin compañía propia se resuelve contra bandas sin compañía, así que "
